Usage:
slacker update --yes; slacker upgrade-all --yes; slacker install-template <sbo_*>; sbopkg-ci -a -i <pkg_name>

Info: When foo.info file mention in required a package that not exist in ponce repo, because slackware64-current already ships in installation. sbopkg-ci ask slacker to search and install it from official slackware repo before start building the rest of queue.
